Lazurio overlay "web-vault: sign in with Lazurio or with email", for
vaultwarden/vw_web_builds d2a095eb800fe80a9bc524579b974796eae51994 (web vault
v2026.7.0).

The login page says "Sign in with Lazurio" for SSO and "Sign in with email" for
the master password path, instead of "Use single sign-on" and "Other". Both
buttons get their own keys, because `other` is shared with other screens. Only
English and Czech carry the texts; every other language falls back to English.
The buttons keep their classes, test ids and handlers, so Vaultwarden's
SSO_ONLY stylesheet still hides the email path.

lazurio/build-web-vault.sh applies this patch with `git apply`.
Runbook: docs/lazurio-fork-release.md.

